[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13630.07, "timestamp": "03:47:10", "text": "130で十分だろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13645.75, "timestamp": "03:47:25", "text": "うーん、それはちょっと変ですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13650.55, "timestamp": "03:47:30", "text": "まあ、仕事はちゃんと終わるからね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13654.309, "timestamp": "03:47:34", "text": "でも、仕事はきちんとこなす。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13656.87, "timestamp": "03:47:36", "text": "だから、大丈夫です。でも、もっと進んだらどうなる？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13658.71, "timestamp": "03:47:38", "text": "それなら、それでうまくいく。よし、みんな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13661.86, "timestamp": "03:47:41", "text": "大丈夫です。大丈夫です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13664.469, "timestamp": "03:47:44", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13666.39, "timestamp": "03:47:46", "text": "DVH"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13677.75, "timestamp": "03:47:57", "text": "わかった。完了しました。終わらせなければならない"}]